---
// Reuses the site's existing `.callout` tokens (accent-soft background, inherited
// `--ink` text) so contrast tracks whatever the rest of the site already uses —
// computed at ~13.8:1 (dark) / ~12.6:1 (paper), both far over the 4.5:1 floor.
---
<div class="callout callout-experimental" role="note" aria-label="Experimental feature">
  <span class="ci" aria-hidden="true">▲</span>
  <p>
    <strong>Experimental</strong> — in force only when <code>specline.yml</code> sets
    <code>unattended: true</code>. Off by default; nothing here is checked or listed
    until you turn it on.
  </p>
</div>
